      "message": "Changed this to make iterateThroughSingleRunByStyles count the width of text ranges (including placeholders) even if the range has no height.\n\nDoes that look safe?",
      "revId": "a1c7cc8370be04342c0edbc603e35db9f858f42d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
