        "id": 8956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-19T19:42:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "run-\u003eadvance().fX will be Inf if the placeholder has infinite width, too.\nThat is the only situation that concerns me. It\u0027s weird and unclear anyway, and I think we will catch it with Google3 testing - so, yes, it\u0027s pretty safe. Just keep an eye on Google3 tests.",
